#!medusa-plugin 1
# A walking survey: hop the whole 2.4 GHz band repeatedly, dwelling long
# enough on each channel to catch a beacon interval, so you can walk a floor
# and come back with coverage rather than a single snapshot.
id site-survey
name Site Survey Sweep
author hartle-tech
version 1
needs rx,storage

> log site survey: 6 passes over channels 1-13
> repeat 6
>   sweep 1 13 400
> end
> log site survey complete
